            that shipped as an EXCLUSION on the strength of an AC parenthetical and a code comment,
            until `2026-09-04-187` found it and `-189` cl.2 ruled it (recorded at `2026-09-07-204`).
            ⚠⛔ IT IS FIRST IN DOCUMENT ORDER DELIBERATELY — a drive that is still collecting is the
            live fact a visitor came for; the two archives below are the record.
            ⛔ Its own `.length > 0` guard, exactly like its siblings: ONE guard per section, ⛔ never
