                  ⭐ THE `<th>`/`<td>` PAIR IS SUPPRESSED TOGETHER by `visibleSahyogColumns()` — an
                  unconditional pair emits an empty cell under a labelled header, so the omission
                  announces itself through the TABLE even though the component stayed silent.
